This is an independent implementation of the VRP v0.1 signed verified-stay
offer verification rules. Its verification behaviour and reason codes are
derived from, and validated against, the public conformance vectors and
reference verifier published in the vrp-spec repository:

  https://github.com/vacationrentalprotocol/vrp-spec

vrp-spec dual-licenses its specification prose under CC0-1.0 and its code
under Apache-2.0. This package uses only that public material; it contains
no vendor-specific code, keys, endpoints, or branding.
